---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AdSenseAd from '../../components/AdSenseAd.astro';

const title = "狗與貓的老化差異：從壽命、速度到徵兆的完整比較";
const description = "狗和貓誰老化更快？全面比較狗與貓的老化歷程，幫助你用正確的方式陪伴不同寵物走過熟齡期。";
const date = "2026-09-29";
const image = "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450778869180-41d0601e046e?w=1200&h=675&fit=crop&fm=webp";

// 修正：靜態獲取路徑，避免 URL 物件在編譯時報錯
const currentPath = Astro.url.pathname;

const siteUrl = "https://www.petaginghub.com";
const hrefLangAlternates = [
  { lang: 'zh-TW', url: siteUrl + '/blog/dog-vs-cat-aging' },
  { lang: 'x-default', url: siteUrl + '/blog/dog-vs-cat-aging' },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: '部落格', url: '/blog/' },
    { label: '寵物健康', url: '/blog/category/health/' },
    { label: '狗與貓的老化差異', url: currentPath }
  ]}
 lang="zh-TW" hrefLangAlternates={hrefLangAlternates}>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="mb-8 md:rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
      <img
        src={image}
        alt="狗和貓的老化歷程對比"
        class="w-full aspect-video object-cover"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <header class="mb-10">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">健康對照</span>
        <span>Updated {date}</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 leading-tight mb-4">{title}</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        狗與貓的生命階段、體型差異及熟齡照護重點並不相同。本篇比較觀察與照護方向；若想直接對照教育性人類年齡估算，請使用<a href="/tools/compare-aging/" class="text-blue-700 underline">狗貓年齡比較工具</a>。
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-400 p-6 rounded-r-2xl my-8">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-lg">📌 本篇重點</h3>
      <ul class="text-slate-700 space-y-2 text-sm md:text-base">
        <li>犬隻體型影響預估壽命，沒有所有狗通用的「老年起始歲數」。</li>
        <li>依 AAHA／AAFP 生命階段指引，貓咪超過 10 歲屬於老年期。</li>
        <li>不論狗貓，體重、行動或行為的明顯改變都值得與獸醫討論。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10 text-center md:text-left md:flex items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="mb-4 md:mb-0">
        <p class="text-blue-600 font-bold text-sm mb-1">快速工具</p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">不確定毛孩的人類年齡？立即計算：</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-2 justify-center">
        <a href="/tools/dog-age-calculator/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold hover:bg-blue-700">🐕 狗狗計算機</a>
        <a href="/tools/cat-age-calculator/" class="px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-lg text-xs font-bold hover:bg-indigo-700">🐱 貓咪計算機</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <AdSenseAd format="in-article" />

    <section class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 border-b pb-2">狗與貓老化維度全面比較</h2>
      
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200">
        <table class="w-full text-sm text-left border-collapse">
          <thead class="bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
            <tr>
              <th class="p-4 font-bold text-slate-700">比較維度</th>
              <th class="p-4 font-bold text-blue-700">🐕 狗狗</th>
              <th class="p-4 font-bold text-indigo-700">🐱 貓咪</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr><td class="p-4 bg-slate-50/30 font-medium">進入老年</td><td class="p-4">預估壽命最後約四分之一；依體型與個體而異</td><td class="p-4">超過 10 歲</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="p-4 bg-slate-50/30 font-medium">值得記錄的變化</td><td class="p-4">活動、上下樓梯與步態</td><td class="p-4">跳躍、理毛與貓砂盆習慣</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="p-4 bg-slate-50/30 font-medium">體重</td><td class="p-4">增減都應查明原因</td><td class="p-4">增減都應查明原因</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <AdSenseAd format="in-article" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-12 mb-6 border-b pb-2">為什麼老化速度不同？</h2>
      <p>狗狗的體型差異大，預估壽命與進入老年期的時間因此有所不同；貓咪則使用另一套生命階段分類。這些是照護討論的起點，不能單靠年齡判斷某隻寵物的健康狀態。</p>
      <p>若出現跛行、食慾或飲水量變化，不要直接歸因於正常老化；可先參考<a href="/blog/dog-aging-signs/">狗狗徵兆</a>、<a href="/blog/cat-aging-signs/">貓咪徵兆</a>，並與獸醫討論。熟齡照護則見<a href="/blog/senior-pet-health-guide/">老年寵物健康監測指南</a>。</p>
    </section>

    <section id="faq" class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">常見問題</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-slate-50 p-5 rounded-2xl group border border-slate-100 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="font-bold flex justify-between items-center list-none">
            狗和貓哪個活得久？
            <span class="text-blue-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform">▼</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">不能只憑物種預測個別壽命。犬隻體型差異很大，貓咪的生活環境與健康狀況也會影響結果；請把壽命範圍當作粗略背景，而非保證。</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200 text-sm text-slate-400">
      <p>最後更新：{date}</p>
      <p class="mt-2">免責聲明：本文章僅供參考。若有醫療疑問，請務必諮詢獸醫師。</p>
      <p>來源：<a href="https://www.aaha.org/resources/2023-aaha-senior-care-guidelines-for-dogs-and-cats/defining-the-senior-patient/">AAHA 熟齡定義</a>；<a href="https://www.aaha.org/aaha-guidelines/2021-aaha-aafp-feline-life-stage-guidelines/">AAHA／AAFP 貓咪生命階段指引</a>。</p>
    </footer>
  </article>

  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "狗與貓的老化差異：從壽命、速度到徵兆的完整比較",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Pet Aging Hub" },
    "dateModified": "2026-09-29"
  }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  article p { line-height: 1.8; color: #334155; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  article table th, article table td { border: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
</style>
